# beard/moustache: Moustache: drooping either side of the mouth
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to HAIR in wave 2). On the head box (STYLE_P2 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role beard moustache
layer beard
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin -5 -12
|abb.bba
|a.....a

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -11 -11
|abb
|a..

view L key rest origin -2 -11
|abb
|..a
